{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104619","id":2417418455,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6QFuDX","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104619","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104619.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104619.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104619","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104619/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104619/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104619/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/6f3c007e3ddc84e4083f161e6337272651fecc0c","number":104619,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Support more controllers on macOS 11+","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"TL;DR: This PR adds support for more controllers on macOS 11+, including individual Joy-Con (L) and Joy-Con (R) controllers.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nA recent PR #103661 improved support for Nintendo Switch Joy-Con controllers when connected together, but I noticed that the support for an individual Joy-Con (L) or Joy-Con (R) was still lacking; only some of its buttons worked on macOS.\r\n\r\nLooking into it more, I found that the current Game Controller support was only for the [`GCExtendedGamepad`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/gamecontroller/gcextendedgamepad?language=objc) and [`GCMicroGamepad`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/gamecontroller/gcmicrogamepad?language=objc) classes; however, macOS registered the individual Joy-Cons as [`GCGamepad`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/gamecontroller/gcgamepad?language=objc). This is a deprecated class according to the online documentation, so I've no idea why it's being used here.\r\n\r\nAnyways, on macOS 11+, `physicalInputProfile` exists, which allows us to get the full controller instead of it being boxed into either an extended gamepad or micro gamepad. From there, we can use some system-provided constants like `GCInputButtonA`, `GCInputLeftThumbstick`, and so on to find the relevant input items on whatever controller we're connecting.\r\n\r\nThe previously-existing `extendedGamepad` and `microGamepad` handling is kept intact, so that if a system isn't on macOS 11+, iOS 13+, or tvOS 13+, it can still fall back to how gamepads were handled before.\r\n\r\n>[!NOTE]\r\n> Despite the branch name and motivation, I can see that the Joy-Con (L) isn't *perfectly* mapped - the A (right) and Y (left) buttons are swapped. It looks like this is another one of Apple's silly mapping mistakes, but I think it might make more sense to address that specific issue in a later PR. This PR's main focus is just to more fully support controllers that don't fit into either the extended or micro gamepad profiles.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097780,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc3ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:macos","name":"platform:macos","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}